{"id":50944,"date":"2026-05-01T10:34:34","date_gmt":"2026-05-01T09:34:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=50944"},"modified":"2026-09-19T18:38:34","modified_gmt":"2026-09-19T17:38:34","slug":"leiria-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/leiria-run\/","title":{"rendered":"Leiria Run 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO DE RESULTADOS E P\u00d3DIO --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-results-module\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.28); border-radius: 20px; padding: 26px; margin: 24px 0 32px 0;\">\n<p>    <!-- CABE\u00c7ALHO DO M\u00d3DULO --><\/p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px;\">\n        <span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 6px 18px; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc6 RESUMO P\u00d3S-PROVA &#038; ESTAT\u00cdSTICAS<\/span><\/p>\n<h3 style=\"margin: 8px 0; color: #FFF; font-size: 1.55rem; font-weight: 800;\">Estat\u00edsticas Oficiais &#038; <span style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Resultados do Pelot\u00e3o<\/span><\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 0.92rem; margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 0;\">11\u00aa Leiria Run realizada a 19 de Setembro de 2026 nas ruas e escadarias hist\u00f3ricas de Leiria<\/p>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<p>    <!-- ESTAT\u00cdSTICAS DO PELOT\u00c3O --><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;\">\n            <span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 0.8rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Total Concluintes (14 km)<\/span><br \/>\n            <strong style=\"color: #FFF; font-size: 1.3rem;\">1.180 Atletas<\/strong>\n        <\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;\">\n            <span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 0.8rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\u26a1 Vencedor Masculino<\/span><br \/>\n            <strong style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 1.15rem;\">Tom\u00e1s Estev\u00e3es (56:10)<\/strong>\n        <\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;\">\n            <span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 0.8rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\u26a1 Vencedora Feminina<\/span><br \/>\n            <strong style=\"color: #F472B6; font-size: 1.15rem;\">Patr\u00edcia Carreira (1:05:46)<\/strong>\n        <\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px; text-align: center;\">\n            <span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 0.8rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Ritmo do Vencedor<\/span><br \/>\n            <strong style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 1.3rem;\">4:01 min\/km<\/strong>\n        <\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<p>    <!-- BARRA VISUAL DE DISTRIBUI\u00c7\u00c3O DE G\u00c9NERO --><\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 22px;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.82rem; color: #E2E8F0; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">\n            <span>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f 71% Masculino (843 finalistas)<\/span><br \/>\n            <span>\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f 29% Feminino (337 finalistas)<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n<div style=\"height: 8px; width: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; display: flex;\">\n<div style=\"width: 71%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #C4B5FD 100%); height: 100%;\"><\/div>\n<div style=\"width: 29%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #EC4899 0%, #F472B6 100%); height: 100%;\"><\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<p>    <!-- ZONA DE ACESSO \u00c0 P\u00c1GINA COMPLETA & DIPLOMAS --><\/p>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.14) 0%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.22) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px; text-align: center;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFF; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 800;\">\ud83c\udfc6 P\u00f3dios, Classifica\u00e7\u00e3o Completa &#038; Top 10<\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #E2E8F0; margin-bottom: 18px; font-size: 0.92rem; max-width: 650px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n            Consulta a p\u00e1gina especial dedicada com os vencedores masculinos e femininos da geral, p\u00f3dios de escal\u00f5es, tempos dos 1.180 finalistas e an\u00e1lise completa de ritmo:\n        <\/p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;\">\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/resultados-leiria-run-2026\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #6D28D9 100%); color: #FFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 12px; padding: 13px 26px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.45);\"><br \/>\n                \u26a1 Ver P\u00e1gina Completa de Resultados &#038; P\u00f3dios<br \/>\n            <\/a><br \/>\n            <a href=\"https:\/\/s3.lap2go.com\/events\/2026\/leiria-run\/Results-Leiria-Run2026-V1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85); color: #C4B5FD; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 12px; padding: 13px 22px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem;\"><br \/>\n                \ud83d\udcc4 PDF Oficial de Classifica\u00e7\u00f5es<br \/>\n            <\/a>\n        <\/div>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO DE RESULTADOS E P\u00d3DIO --><br \/>\n<!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Leiria Run 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Leiria Run 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se na noite de <strong>19 de setembro de 2026<\/strong> na hist\u00f3rica cidade de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Organizada pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Leiria<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Teatro Jos\u00e9 L\u00facio da Silva<\/strong>, com a parceria de clubes desportivos locais (ADAL, CA Barreira, COC, Juventude Vidigalense, LizRunners e NEL), a prova \u00e9 a maior festa desportiva de corrida noturna e urban trail da regi\u00e3o do Lis.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Pra\u00e7a Rodrigues Lobo<\/strong> e meta consagrada no relvado do <strong>Est\u00e1dio Municipal Dr. Magalh\u00e3es Pessoa<\/strong>, o tra\u00e7ado desafia os atletas por escadarias, cal\u00e7adas e miradouros com passagem marcante pelo interior do <strong>Castelo de Leiria<\/strong>. O programa integra a <strong>Corrida de 14 km<\/strong> (20:00) e a <strong>Caminhada de 9 km<\/strong> (19:00), incluindo cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip Lap2Go, abastecimentos e anima\u00e7\u00e3o final.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; 