xima de 2h30 (meta encerra \u00e0s 22:30), enquanto a Caminhada de 9 km tem uma dura\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e1xima de 3h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e resultados oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es e tempos oficiais da prova ficam dispon\u00edveis na plataforma Lap2Go logo ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o dos eventos, com liga\u00e7\u00e3o direta no portal Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67689,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,559],"event_type_2":[38,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50944","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-leiria","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-de-15-km","event_type_2-leiria","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-leiria-run.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50944","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=50944"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50944\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":67691,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/50944\/revisions\/67691"}]